#==============================================================================================
#
#   custom_element_registry - what phase 1 needs of HTML::CustomElementRegistry: the registry
#   cell every new Document gets, and looking definitions up in its (empty) definition set
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/HTML/CustomElements/CustomElementRegistry.cpp lines 36-54
#       (the constructor, initialize, visit_edges) and 463-475 (append_scoped_document,
#       get_definition_with_name_and_local_name), with is_scoped of CustomElementRegistry.h,
#       taken by region r28 for Document::create_and_initialize. Defining custom elements (and
#       the rest of the file) needs scripts: phase 3.
